      <section aria-labelledby="b-broke">
        <h2 id="b-broke">What broke</h2>
        <p>Wear the glasses and you are tethered to a battery pack by a wire. It is
        three separate things you put on your body, not one integrated device.</p>
        <p>We ran the field test once, in that room, with that person. We do not know
        what the kit does after a month of someone wearing it every day, because we
        never got the chance to find out. It was a prototype and it behaved like one:
        it worked in the room we tested it in, and we cannot say more than that.</p>
      </section>

      <section aria-labelledby="b-outcome">
        <h2 id="b-outcome">The outcome</h2>
        <p>We went to TEKNOFEST Black Sea, in Samsun, in September 2022, and won Best
        Presentation. Anadolu Agency and Faktor.ba both covered it on their own, and
        TEKNOFEST's own finalist registry lists our team, ABRT01. It is the one claim
        on this page nobody has to take my word for.</p>
      </section>
